    dcterm:created "2017-05-31T21:31:51.026000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[APT30](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0013) is a threat group suspected to be associated with the Chinese government. While [Naikon](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0019) shares some characteristics with [APT30](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0013), the two groups do not appear to be exact matches." ;
