<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/group/G0038> a attack:AdversaryGroup ;
    dcterm:created "2017-05-31T21:32:06.390000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Stealth Falcon](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0038) is a threat group that has conducted targeted spyware attacks against Emirati journalists, activists, and dissidents since at least 2012. Circumstantial evidence suggests there could be a link between this group and the United Arab Emirates (UAE) government, but that has not been confirmed." ;
