<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/group/G0066> a attack:AdversaryGroup ;
    dcterm:created "2018-04-18T17:59:24.739000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Elderwood](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0066) is a suspected Chinese cyber espionage group that was reportedly responsible for the 2009 Google intrusion known as Operation Aurora. The group has targeted defense organizations, supply chain manufacturers, human rights and nongovernmental organizations (NGOs), and IT service providers." ;
