<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/group/G0069> a attack:AdversaryGroup ;
    dcterm:created "2018-04-18T17:59:24.739000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[MuddyWater](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0069) is a cyber espionage group assessed to be a subordinate element within Iran's Ministry of Intelligence and Security (MOIS). Since at least 2017, [MuddyWater](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0069) has targeted a range of government and private organizations across sectors, including telecommunications, local government, defense, and oil and natural gas organizations, in the Middle East, Asia, Africa, Europe, and North America." ;
