<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/group/G1016> a attack:AdversaryGroup ;
    dcterm:created "2023-07-27T15:24:02.162000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[FIN13](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1016) is a financially motivated cyber threat group that has targeted the financial, retail, and hospitality industries in Mexico and Latin America, as early as 2016. [FIN13](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1016) achieves its objectives by stealing intellectual property, financial data, mergers and acquisition information, or PII." ;
    dcterm:identifier "G1016" ;
