        <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0552>,
        <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S1040> ;
    attack:usesTechnique <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/technique/T1018>,
        <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/technique/T1078>,
        <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/technique/T1133>,
