<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/group/G1031> a attack:AdversaryGroup ;
    dcterm:created "2024-05-25T16:11:54.881000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Saint Bear](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1031) is a Russian-nexus threat actor active since early 2021, primarily targeting entities in Ukraine and Georgia. The group is notable for a specific remote access tool, [Saint Bot](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1018), and information stealer, [OutSteel](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1017) in campaigns. [Saint Bear](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1031) typically relies on phishing or web staging of malicious documents and related file types for initial access, spoofing government or related entities. [Saint Bear](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1031) has previously been confused with [Ember Bear](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1003) operations, but analysis of behaviors, tools, and targeting indicates these are distinct clusters." ;
    dcterm:identifier "G1031" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-08-12T17:32:47.430000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "Saint Bear" ;
    attack:aliases "Lorec53",
