<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0007> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2017-05-31T21:32:13.407000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Skeleton Key](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0007) is malware used to inject false credentials into domain controllers with the intent of creating a backdoor password. Functionality similar to [Skeleton Key](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0007) is included as a module in [Mimikatz](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0002)." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0007" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-02-06T19:02:00.781000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "Skeleton Key" ;
    attack:implementsTechnique <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/technique/T1556.001> .

<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0027> a attack:Malware ;
