<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0047> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2017-05-31T21:32:35.389000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Hacking Team UEFI Rootkit](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0047) is a rootkit developed by the company Hacking Team as a method of persistence for remote access software." ;
