<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0112> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2017-05-31T21:33:07.565000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[ROCKBOOT](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0112) is a [Bootkit](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1542/003) that has been used by an unidentified, suspected China-based group." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0112" ;
