<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0465> a attack:Software ;
    dcterm:created "2020-06-02T19:10:29.513000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[CARROTBALL](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0465) is an FTP downloader utility that has been in use since at least 2019. [CARROTBALL](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0465) has been used as a downloader to install [SYSCON](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0464)." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0465" ;
