<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0578> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2021-02-18T17:35:13.361000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[SUPERNOVA](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0578) is an in-memory web shell written in .NET C#. It was discovered in November 2020 during the investigation of [APT29](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0016)'s SolarWinds cyber operation but determined to be unrelated. Subsequent analysis suggests [SUPERNOVA](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0578) may have been used by the China-based threat group SPIRAL." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0578" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-04-10T23:45:34.261000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "SUPERNOVA" ;
