<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S1106> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2024-02-08T15:23:05.910000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[NGLite](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1106) is a backdoor Trojan that is only capable of running commands received through its C2 channel. While the capabilities are standard for a backdoor, NGLite uses a novel C2 channel that leverages a decentralized network based on the legitimate NKN to communicate between the backdoor and the actors." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S1106" ;
