    dcterm:created "2024-03-05T19:32:16.643000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[WARPWIRE](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1116) is a Javascript credential stealer that targets plaintext passwords and usernames for exfiltration that was used during [Cutting Edge](https://attack.mitre.org/campaigns/C0029) to target Ivanti Connect Secure VPNs." ;
