    dcterm:created "2024-03-07T20:52:41.463000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[LIGHTWIRE](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1119) is a web shell written in Perl that was used during [Cutting Edge](https://attack.mitre.org/campaigns/C0029) to maintain access and enable command execution by imbedding into the legitimate compcheckresult.cgi component of Ivanti Secure Connect VPNs." ;
