<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S1125> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2024-03-25T15:27:08.214000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[AcidRain](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1125) is an ELF binary targeting modems and routers using MIPS architecture. [AcidRain](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1125) is associated with the ViaSat KA-SAT communication outage that took place during the initial phases of the 2022 full-scale invasion of Ukraine. Analysis indicates overlap with another network device-targeting malware, VPNFilter, associated with [Sandworm Team](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0034). US and European government sources linked [AcidRain](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1125) to Russian government entities, while Ukrainian government sources linked [AcidRain](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1125) specifically to [Sandworm Team](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0034)." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S1125" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-04-12T10:20:50.199000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "AcidRain" ;
    attack:implementsTechnique <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/technique/T1083>,
        <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/technique/T1485>,
        <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/technique/T1529>,
        <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/technique/T1561.001> .

<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S1136> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2024-05-22T22:51:51.324000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[BFG Agonizer](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1136) is a wiper related to the open-source project CRYLINE-v.5.0. The malware is associated with wiping operations conducted by the [Agrius](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1030) threat actor." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S1136" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-08-29T15:21:10.780000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "BFG Agonizer" ;
