<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S1084> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2023-08-17T17:06:19.976000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[QUIETEXIT](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1084) is a novel backdoor, based on the open-source Dropbear SSH client-server software, that has been used by [APT29](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0016) since at least 2021. [APT29](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0016) has deployed [QUIETEXIT](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1084) on opaque network appliances that typically don't support antivirus or endpoint detection and response tools within a victim environment." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S1084" ;
    dcterm:modified "2023-10-02T21:29:35.492000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "QUIETEXIT" ;
