<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0051> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2017-05-31T21:32:36.919000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[MiniDuke](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0051) is malware that was used by [APT29](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0016) from 2010 to 2015. The [MiniDuke](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0051) toolset consists of multiple downloader and backdoor components. The loader has been used with other [MiniDuke](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0051) components as well as in conjunction with [CosmicDuke](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0050) and [PinchDuke](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0048)." ;
