<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0075> a attack:Software ;
    dcterm:created "2017-05-31T21:32:49+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description """[Reg](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0075) is a Windows utility used to interact with the Windows Registry. It can be used at the command-line interface to query, add, modify, and remove information.

Utilities such as [Reg](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0075) are known to be used by persistent threats.""" ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0075" ;
