<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S1155> a attack:Software ;
    dcterm:created "2024-09-04T17:08:08.985000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Covenant](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1155) is a multi-platform command and control framework written in .NET. While designed for penetration testing and security research, the tool has also been used by threat actors such as [HAFNIUM](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0125) during operations. [Covenant](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1155) functions through a central listener managing multiple deployed \"Grunts\" that communicate back to the controller." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S1155" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-09-06T18:11:55.619000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "Covenant" ;
