<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S1144> a attack:Software ;
    dcterm:created "2024-07-10T18:46:33.555000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[FRP](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1144), which stands for Fast Reverse Proxy, is an openly available tool that is capable of exposing a server located behind a firewall or Network Address Translation (NAT) to the Internet. [FRP](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1144) can support multiple protocols including TCP, UDP, and HTTP(S) and has been abused by threat actors to proxy command and control communications." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S1144" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-07-30T18:17:09.725000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "FRP" ;
