<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0241> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2018-10-17T00:14:20.652000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[RATANKBA](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0241) is a remote controller tool used by [Lazarus Group](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0032). [RATANKBA](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0241) has been used in attacks targeting financial institutions in Poland, Mexico, Uruguay, the United Kingdom, and Chile. It was also seen used against organizations related to telecommunications, management consulting, information technology, insurance, aviation, and education. [RATANKBA](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0241) has a graphical user interface to allow the attacker to issue jobs to perform on the infected machines." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0241" ;
    dcterm:modified "2022-04-25T14:00:00.188000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "RATANKBA" ;
