<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0341> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2019-01-30T13:28:47.452000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Xbash](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0341) is a malware family that has targeted Linux and Microsoft Windows servers. The malware has been tied to the Iron Group, a threat actor group known for previous ransomware attacks. [Xbash](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0341) was developed in Python and then converted into a self-contained Linux ELF executable by using PyInstaller." ;
