<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S1139> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2024-06-06T18:28:58.878000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[INC Ransomware](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1139) is a ransomware strain that has been used by the [INC Ransom](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1032) group since at least 2023 against multiple industry sectors worldwide. [INC Ransomware](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1139) can employ partial encryption combined with multi-threading to speed encryption." ;
