<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0384> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2019-05-30T19:47:37.192000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Dridex](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0384) is a prolific banking Trojan that first appeared in 2014. By December 2019, the US Treasury estimated [Dridex](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0384) had infected computers in hundreds of banks and financial institutions in over 40 countries, leading to more than $100 million in theft. [Dridex](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0384) was created from the source code of the Bugat banking Trojan (also known as Cridex)." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0384" ;
    dcterm:modified "2023-08-03T21:55:20.998000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "Dridex" ;
    attack:aliases "Bugat v5" ;
    attack:implementsTechnique <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/technique/T1027>,
