<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0575> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2021-02-17T18:51:57.710000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Conti](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0575) is a Ransomware-as-a-Service (RaaS) that was first observed in December 2019. [Conti](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0575) has been deployed via [TrickBot](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0266) and used against major corporations and government agencies, particularly those in North America. As with other ransomware families, actors using [Conti](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0575) steal sensitive files and information from compromised networks, and threaten to publish this data unless the ransom is paid." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0575" ;
