        <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0498>,
        <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0631>,
        <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0662>,
        <http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0681>,
