<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0448> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2020-05-14T22:29:25.653000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Rising Sun](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0448) is a modular backdoor that was used extensively in [Operation Sharpshooter](https://attack.mitre.org/campaigns/C0013) between 2017 and 2019. [Rising Sun](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0448) infected at least 87 organizations around the world, including nuclear, defense, energy, and financial service companies. Security researchers assessed [Rising Sun](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0448) included some source code from [Lazarus Group](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0032)'s Trojan Duuzer." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0448" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-04-11T00:14:23.264000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "Rising Sun" ;
