<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0647> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2021-09-21T15:21:31.795000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Turian](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0647) is a backdoor that has been used by [BackdoorDiplomacy](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0135) to target Ministries of Foreign Affairs, telecommunication companies, and charities in Africa, Europe, the Middle East, and Asia. First reported in 2021, [Turian](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0647) is likely related to Quarian, an older backdoor that was last observed being used in 2013 against diplomatic targets in Syria and the United States." ;
