<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0180> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2018-01-16T16:13:52.465000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Volgmer](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0180) is a backdoor Trojan designed to provide covert access to a compromised system. It has been used since at least 2013 to target the government, financial, automotive, and media industries. Its primary delivery mechanism is suspected to be spearphishing." ;
