<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0357> a attack:Software ;
    dcterm:created "2019-01-31T01:39:56.283000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Impacket](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0357) is an open source collection of modules written in Python for programmatically constructing and manipulating network protocols. [Impacket](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0357) contains several tools for remote service execution, Kerberos manipulation, Windows credential dumping, packet sniffing, and relay attacks." ;
