<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0140> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2017-05-31T21:33:20.223000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Shamoon](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0140) is wiper malware that was first used by an Iranian group known as the \"Cutting Sword of Justice\" in 2012. Other versions known as Shamoon 2 and Shamoon 3 were observed in 2016 and 2018. [Shamoon](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0140) has also been seen leveraging [RawDisk](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0364) and Filerase to carry out data wiping tasks. Analysis has linked [Shamoon](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0140) with [Kwampirs](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0236) based on multiple shared artifacts and coding patterns. The term Shamoon is sometimes used to refer to the group using the malware as well as the malware itself." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0140" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-02-08T20:53:17.332000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "Shamoon" ;
