<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S1016> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2022-05-06T01:29:34.860000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[MacMa](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1016) is a macOS-based backdoor with a large set of functionalities to control and exfiltrate files from a compromised computer. [MacMa](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1016) has been observed in the wild since November 2021. [MacMa](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1016) shares command and control and unique libraries with [MgBot](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1146) and [Nightdoor](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1147), indicating a relationship with the [Daggerfly](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1034) threat actor." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S1016" ;
