    dcterm:created "2020-02-20T21:09:55.995000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "An adversary may compress or encrypt data that is collected prior to exfiltration using a custom method. Adversaries may choose to use custom archival methods, such as encryption with XOR or stream ciphers implemented with no external library or utility references. Custom implementations of well-known compression algorithms have also been used." ;
