<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0356> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2019-01-31T00:36:39.771000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[KONNI](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0356) is a remote access tool that security researchers assess has been used by North Korean cyber actors since at least 2014. [KONNI](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0356) has significant code overlap with the [NOKKI](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0353) malware family, and has been linked to several suspected North Korean campaigns targeting political organizations in Russia, East Asia, Europe and the Middle East; there is some evidence potentially linking [KONNI](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0356) to [APT37](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0067)." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0356" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-04-11T01:44:46.026000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "KONNI" ;
