<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0531> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2020-11-10T21:13:44.259000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Grandoreiro](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0531) is a banking trojan written in Delphi that was first observed in 2016 and uses a Malware-as-a-Service (MaaS) business model. [Grandoreiro](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0531) has confirmed victims in Brazil, Mexico, Portugal, and Spain." ;
