<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0192> a attack:Software ;
    dcterm:created "2018-04-18T17:59:24.739000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Pupy](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0192) is an open source, cross-platform (Windows, Linux, OSX, Android) remote administration and post-exploitation tool. It is written in Python and can be generated as a payload in several different ways (Windows exe, Python file, PowerShell oneliner/file, Linux elf, APK, Rubber Ducky, etc.). [Pupy](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0192) is publicly available on GitHub." ;
