<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0603> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2020-12-14T17:34:58.457000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Stuxnet](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0603) was the first publicly reported piece of malware to specifically target industrial control systems devices. [Stuxnet](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0603) is a large and complex piece of malware that utilized multiple different behaviors including multiple zero-day vulnerabilities, a sophisticated Windows rootkit, and network infection routines. [Stuxnet](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0603) was discovered in 2010, with some components being used as early as November 2008." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0603" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-04-10T23:46:32.577000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "Stuxnet" ;
