<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S1160> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2024-09-16T18:47:30.547000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Latrodectus](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1160) is a Windows malware downloader that has been used since at least 2023 to download and execute additional payloads and modules. [Latrodectus](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1160) has most often been distributed through email campaigns, primarily by [TA577](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1037) and [TA578](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1038), and has infrastructure overlaps with historic [IcedID](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0483) operations." ;
