<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0367> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2019-03-25T18:35:14.353000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[Emotet](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0367) is a modular malware variant which is primarily used as a downloader for other malware variants such as [TrickBot](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0266) and [IcedID](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0483). Emotet first emerged in June 2014, initially targeting the financial sector, and has expanded to multiple verticals over time." ;
