<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S1111> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2024-02-09T19:52:30.428000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[DarkGate](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1111) first emerged in 2018 and has evolved into an initial access and data gathering tool associated with various criminal cyber operations. Written in Delphi and named \"DarkGate\" by its author, [DarkGate](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1111) is associated with credential theft, cryptomining, cryptotheft, and pre-ransomware actions. DarkGate use increased significantly starting in 2022 and is under active development by its author, who provides it as a Malware-as-a-Service offering." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S1111" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-09-29T10:22:45.776000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:title "DarkGate" ;
