<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0692> a attack:Software ;
    dcterm:created "2022-03-23T19:34:30.486000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[SILENTTRINITY](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0692) is an open source remote administration and post-exploitation framework primarily written in Python that includes stagers written in Powershell, C, and Boo. [SILENTTRINITY](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0692) was used in a 2019 campaign against Croatian government agencies by unidentified cyber actors." ;
