<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/attack/software/S0266> a attack:Malware ;
    dcterm:created "2018-10-17T00:14:20.652000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterm:description "[TrickBot](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0266) is a Trojan spyware program written in C++ that first emerged in September 2016 as a possible successor to [Dyre](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0024). [TrickBot](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0266) was developed and initially used by [Wizard Spider](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0102) for targeting banking sites in North America, Australia, and throughout Europe; it has since been used against all sectors worldwide as part of \"big game hunting\" ransomware campaigns." ;
    dcterm:identifier "S0266" ;
    dcterm:modified "2024-04-10T22:28:21.746000+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
